1
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,720
What are we now?

2
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,720
Why are you asking this out of nowhere?

3
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,360
You were passed out,

4
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:18,560
so I just wanted to change your clothes

5
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,220
to make you more comfortable.

6
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:28,720
Only my girlfriend can kiss me, touch me,

7
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,160
and change my pants.

8
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,020
Give me a break.

9
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,860
I think I've pretty much
seen everything on you,

10
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,440
whether I should have or not.

11
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,960
That's because I like you.

12
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,180
I've liked you for a long time.

13
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,759
The past is the past.

14
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,120
I still like you now.

15
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:52,560
Date me,

16
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,240
and I'll give you this puzzle piece.

17
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,080
Are you threatening me?

18
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,479
I'm not threatening you.

19
00:01:58,759 --> 00:01:59,690
I'm begging you.

20
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:08,400
I think you're really drunk.

21
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,520
I don't talk to drunks.

22
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,130
Take a shower and go to sleep yourself.

23
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,360
I'm leaving now.

24
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,079
What a backfire.

25
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,920
I just wanted to test the waters,

26
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:35,840
and he actually wants to talk to me...

27
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,840
Yun Qingqing,

28
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,600
you're just too charming.

29
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,840
But Yue Shanchuan insisted on giving me

30
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,240
this bag last night,

31
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,360
and Shu Rong told me to throw it away.

32
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,820
Should I keep it or toss it?

33
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,600
What's even in here?

34
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,000
If it's something valuable,

35
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,530
I can't afford to pay for it.

36
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,160
Hello.

37
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:09,720
Hello.

38
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:10,960
Nice to meet you.

39
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,600
I'm Yue Shanchuan's mother.

40
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,720
Hello, ma'am.

41
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:15,440
I'm...

42
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,480
I know who you are.

43
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,800
I saw you downstairs last time.

44
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,240
You're so pretty,

45
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,720
yet Shanchuan kept you hidden from me.

46
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,300
So I came to see you myself.

47
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,880
Thank you for taking care
of our Shanchuan.

48
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,720
It's nothing, ma'am.

49
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,560
Just lifting a finger.

50
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,600
Are you looking for Shanchuan today?

51
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,480
He's not here.

52
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,560
No, I came to see you.

53
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,480
I didn't know what you like,

54
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,200
so I made some desserts.

55
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,800
Things girls usually love.

56
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,090
Come on, let's go inside
and chat while we eat.

57
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,079
Sure, let's go.

58
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,960
Our Shanchuan is such a good boy.

59
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,720
Not only is he handsome,

60
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,400
but he also has a great personality.

61
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,200
He's kind, hardworking,

62
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,320
and smart.

63
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,560
His biggest misfortune in life

64
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,880
is having a useless mother like me.

65
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:07,760
Ma'am, please don't say that.

66
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,920
After his heartless father

67
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,480
abandoned us,

68
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,360
I had to work day and night

69
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,560
to raise the kids.

70
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:21,160
As a result,
my health deteriorated early on.

71
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,920
A few years ago,

72
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,520
I even had a major illness.

73
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,360
Are you feeling better now?

74
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,420
It's okay.
Good things come after great hardships.

75
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,600
So now,

76
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,320
I just hope Shanchuan

77
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,200
can meet someone who truly loves him

78
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,960
and will stay with him for life.

79
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,159
Yes, of course.

80
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:44,760
Parents always plan
for their children's future.

81
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:49,520
There's something I must tell you.

82
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,560
To save me,

83
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,880
Shanchuan took on a debt of 200,000.

84
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,000
He works day and night now

85
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,600
just to pay it off as soon as possible.

86
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,380
No wonder he works so hard.

87
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:04,000
I thought he just loved working.

88
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,760
If he could pay off this debt sooner,

89
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,860
our whole family could
breathe a sigh of relief.

90
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:15,120
And Shanchuan could spend more time
with his girlfriend.

91
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,410
It's all my fault

92
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,160
for getting sick.

93
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,800
I can't work,

94
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,600
and I have to take medicine constantly.

95
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,960
Even though it's my first time
meeting you,

96
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:27,520
I can tell

97
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,680
you're a kind-hearted girl.

98
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:33,340
You wouldn't look down on him, would you?

99
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,760
N-No.

100
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,440
Why would I despise him?

101
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,240
Right.

102
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:43,120
This amount of money is nothing to you,

103
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,840
right?

104
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,120
Wait a minute, ma'am.

105
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,320
You mean

106
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:53,120
you want me to advance him
200,000 in salary?

107
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,400
Look at you.

108
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,880
What's with the 'salary'?

109
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,120
That sounds so harsh.

110
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,080
When you get married,

111
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,680
your money will be pooled together

112
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,280
as joint property.

113
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:06,000
Besides, our Shanchuan is smart
and hardworking.

114
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,160
You can hand over your family business

115
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,400
to him in the future.

116
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,000
No, no, no.

117
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,940
Who's getting married to him?

118
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,600
Look at you, getting shy.

119
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:16,280
I know you two are already
living together.

120
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,120
No, ma'am.

121
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:20,240
How can you just spread
dirty rumors about people?

122
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:22,600
I've barely even spoken
a few words to Yue Shanchuan.

123
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,160
Did you two have a fight?

124
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,520
Shanchuan is just stubborn.

125
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,000
If he offended you,

126
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,800
I apologize to you on his behalf.

127
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:30,680
Mom,

128
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,800
what are you doing here?

129
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,330
You're just in time.

130
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:36,600
Hurry up and apologize to your girlfriend.

131
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,920
Couples always make up after a fight.

132
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,360
There's no overnight grudge.

133
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,440
You've got it all wrong.

134
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,480
Let's go.

135
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,000
What do you mean?

136
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,080
Did she sleep with you
and refuse to take responsibility?

137
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,960
There's no such thing
as a free ride in this world.

138
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:48,440
I'm sorry.

139
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,159
This is a misunderstanding.

140
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:51,220
I'll explain it to you clearly later.

141
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,280
No wonder he's so broke.

142
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,210
Turns out he has a bloodsucker at home.

143
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,200
Child,

144
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:06,640
why did you

145
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:09,360
drag me away?

146
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,280
Let's go back and explain it to her.

147
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,240
Didn't I tell you?

148
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,440
Stop looking for her.

149
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,560
My silly son.

150
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,480
Pride won't feed you.

151
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,520
Listen to me.

152
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,840
Go back, soften up, and apologize.

153
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:20,760
If you coax her well,

154
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:23,120
you'll have endless wealth
for the rest of your life.

155
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,920
Why can't you learn from your sister?

156
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,380
That's exactly how
you ruined Yue Yingying.

157
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,800
I ruined her?

158
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:31,000
She's living so comfortably now.

159
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:31,880
Comfortably?

160
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,840
She'll follow in your footsteps
sooner or later.

161
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,920
When you were young, you were ambitious,

162
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,880
determined to catch a rich husband

163
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:39,340
and live as a wealthy wife.

164
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,120
You finally met my dad

165
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,000
and married into
your so-called rich family.

166
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,760
What a pity.

167
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,960
You were greedy and extravagant.

168
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,000
The good days didn't last long

169
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,530
before my dad divorced you.

170
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,240
Back then, you didn't want Yue Yingying

171
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:52,159
and tried every way
to keep me by your side.

172
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:53,960
Not because you loved me so much,

173
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:55,680
but because I was a son.

174
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:58,680
You just wanted to use me
to get more child support.

175
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:01,800
Unfortunately, the Yue family
still went bankrupt.

176
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,760
I was no longer of any use to you.

177
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:06,680
You turned your attention to Yue Yingying,

178
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:08,620
instilling twisted ideas in her.

179
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,960
You even took out loans
to send her to study abroad,

180
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,560
just so she could be like you,

181
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,040
catch a rich husband,

182
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:16,300
and find a long-term meal ticket.

183
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,080
What exactly are Yue Yingying
and I to you?

184
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,480
Are we more like tools

185
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,850
for you to climb up than your children?

186
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,530
Your wings have grown hard.

187
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,610
I can't control you anymore, can I?

188
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:33,929
Fine.

189
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,120
I just want 200,000

190
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,679
as repayment for giving birth to you.

191
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,960
Once I get the money,

192
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,400
we're even.

193
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:44,420
I don't have any money.

194
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,400
Even if I did,

195
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,780
I would never give it to you again.

196
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:31,900
Where was the aurora in the puzzle taken?

197
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:40,600
What does this mean?

198
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:44,440
How can someone just ignore me
after confessing their feelings?

199
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,300
Do I have to reach out to him first?

200
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,570
This is completely backwards.

201
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:54,640
Playing hard to get with me, huh?

202
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,540
Good thing I reacted fast.

203
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,730
Let's see how long you can hold out.

204
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,200
Daughter-in-law,

205
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,000
save me! Daughter-in-law!

206
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,640
Daughter-in-law, please save me!

207
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:09,700
Daughter-in-law,

208
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,960
save me!

209
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,780
Daughter-in-law!

210
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,200
She's my daughter-in-law.

211
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:20,040
She has money. Ask her for it.

212
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,960
What daughter-in-law? I'm not.

213
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:29,040
Isn't this the girl
who fought us tooth and nail?

214
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,320
Didn't we just see her
a couple of days ago?

215
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:32,280
No, what is wrong with you?

216
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,720
You owed money with your friend,

217
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,480
and now you owe money with your boyfriend?

218
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,000
Is there no end to this?

219
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,480
I'm innocent, boss.

220
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:42,130
I'm really not
this lady's daughter-in-law.

221
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,120
I know

222
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:45,200
you really like our Shanchuan, right?

223
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,040
Good girl,

224
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,760
just help me this once.

225
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,360
100,000. Just 100,000,

226
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,360
and I'll agree to you
and Shanchuan being together.

227
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,080
I'll even let Shanchuan marry
into your family.

228
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:56,600
100,000? Didn't you say
200,000 this morning?

229
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,560
Just 100,000.

230
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,760
I know it's not easy for you two either.

231
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:02,600
Our Shanchuan can make money
and do chores.

232
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,330
You definitely won't lose out.

233
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,640
What on earth is going on?

234
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:07,160
What money does this lady owe?

235
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:09,440
Gambling debts. 100,000.

236
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:11,240
Today is the last day.

237
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,680
Pay up now.

238
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,640
100,000.

239
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:17,840
If I can't pay it back today...

240
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:18,160
Ma'am,

241
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,800
please don't do this.

242
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,880
Ma'am, get up first.

243
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,640
Do you know what time it is?
What's all the noise?

244
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:26,560
Please save me.

245
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,050
What's going on?

246
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:31,220
This lady is Yue Shanchuan's mother.

247
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,480
She owes gambling debts.

248
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,640
These guys are here to collect.

249
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:36,880
If she can't pay,

250
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,530
they'll chop off her hands.

251
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,400
Girl,

252
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,240
you're too kind.

253
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:53,920
Look,

254
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,320
don't make it too strong.

255
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,240
Come on.

256
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,040
Brothers, have a drink.

257
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,080
You must be thirsty

258
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,370
after all that fuss.

259
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:06,880
To be honest,

260
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,200
our line of work

261
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,640
is quite hard.

262
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,280
Not to mention waking up early,

263
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,680
we have to be on call 24/7.

264
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,600
The clients we deal with

265
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,640
are so hard to please.

266
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,840
They're all troublemakers.

267
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:18,640
I understand.

268
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,440
People as easygoing as you

269
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:22,100
are basically non-existent.

270
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,360
Trust me,

271
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,400
don't listen to that lady's nonsense.

272
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,040
In our business,

273
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:30,040
we collect debts legally and reasonably.

274
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:31,440
We never do things like chopping off hands

275
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,800
or killing people.

276
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:34,360
Look,

277
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,880
even this tattoo is fading.

278
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:38,360
It's fake, just to scare people.

279
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,440
I get it.

280
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,040
We're all Party B,

281
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:41,960
all in the service industry,

282
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,240
all working like horses.

283
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,440
Tell me about it.

284
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:47,400
Look at me, just talking.

285
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,600
Keep this safe.

286
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,240
In the future,

287
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,400
if you have any debt issues,

288
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,760
feel free to contact me anytime.

289
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,200
Our business is quite extensive.

290
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:02,440
Like feeding cats at home,

291
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,640
Japanese-style moving,

292
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:04,040
right?

293
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,080
We can do it all.

294
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:06,520
As long as you can think of it,

295
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,840
