299
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,160
Are you okay?

300
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:20,840
I left my phone in the room.
I didn't hear it.

301
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,800
Don't worry, it's all solved.

302
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:24,360
Look, everything is peaceful.

303
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,000
It's fine.

304
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:26,360
Well,

305
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,120
if there's nothing else,
we'll take off first.

306
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,040
It's getting late,

307
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:29,760
right?

308
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,720
I'll take the trash at the door with me.

309
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:32,600
Take care.

310
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,440
Thanks, bro.

311
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:33,970
Let's go.

312
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,040
Take care.

313
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,770
What's going on, Qingqing?

314
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,920
Are you really okay?

315
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:41,720
I'm fine.

316
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:45,440
No wonder she's been pitching you
to me for so long.

317
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:47,600
A handsome guy like you for only 100,000

318
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,660
is quite a bargain.

319
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:53,200
She came for money again.

320
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,360
She owes a huge gambling debt.

321
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,840
The debt collectors just left.

322
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:02,480
She...

323
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,040
So you helped me?

324
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,600
She mistook me

325
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,040
for your boyfriend.

326
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,400
I don't have any money.

327
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:12,480
I can't even scrape together 5,000.

328
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:14,960
But

329
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:19,320
a kind-hearted person stepped in

330
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:22,800
and solved it for you.
